            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "Test the dexterity of your fingers and the strength of your resolve with this original yet familiar game.<br />\r\nThe objective is simple: guide the orb through each level's course to the end. But do not be fooled. Within lies many perils to be braved: high-speed electric repulsion fields, teleporters, pressure-sensitive drop platforms, and various other obstacles.<br />\r\nBut the greatest opposition on your path to victory... is YOU.<br />\r\nWill you second guess your jump?<br />\r\nWill you underestimate your momentum?<br />\r\nWill you let down your guard?<br />\r\nFrom laughable to seemingly impossible, will you keep victory in sight? Or let it roll away?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWelcome to the Rolling Gauntlet Trials.<br />\r\nSee if you are ready to traverse the universe in four demo levels.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFULL GAME INCLUDES:<br />\r\n* Forty stages<br />\r\n* Eight Unlockable Skins<br />\r\n* Level Select",
